OL,3,GNEWSAHousing estate to be knocked down
OL,4,Ain the new year
OL,5,
OL,6,FA housing estate plagued by "vandalism,
OL,7,Fanti-social behaviour" will be
OL,8,Fdemolished in the new year as part of a
OL,9,Fregeneration scheme, Milton Keynes City
OL,10,FCouncil said.
OL,12,FThe Serpentine Court on the Lakes
OL,13,FEstate in Bletchley will be pulled down
OL,14,Fat a cost of #6m, with contractors due
OL,15,Fon site by Christmas.
OL,17,FThe move follows the completion of 183
OL,18,Fnew modern, energy-efficient council
OL,19,Fhomes earlier this year, which local
OL,20,Ffamilies started moving into in March
OL,21,F2026.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
