OL,3,GNEWSAHousing estate to be knocked down
OL,4,Ain the new year
OL,5,
OL,6,FCabinet member for housing Ed Hume
OL,7,Fsaid: "We know Serpentine Court holds a
OL,8,Fspecial place in the community and many
OL,9,Flocal people raised their families
OL,10,Fthere, but the building has now reached
OL,11,Fthe end of its life."
